5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The current system is failing. I need to know the true monthly cost before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am worried about the time commitment. We need to know how long a proper clean actually takes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The workload feels uneven. I want to see who is actually using the spaces versus who is cleaning them.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I am tired of guessing the state of the rooms. I need a standard for what ""done"" means.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I care about our relationships. I want to know what the previous tenants did to avoid conflict.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if the hours are high, we might need to pay someone else.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, I agree. But I need the data first to justify the cost.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, if we define ""done"" clearly, the friction might disappear.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, yes, but I also need to know if the effort is distributed fairly.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, I am looking into the history to see what worked before.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the receipts to see the actual spending.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will time a full cleaning pass to get real numbers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will watch the kitchen usage for a fortnight.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I will check the chat logs to see what causes arguments.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will read the note left by the previous tenants.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will also check the management office rate sheet.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will also check the standard terms of the outside firm.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the absences on the wall calendar.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I will also check what each housemate counts as done.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,I will also check the bathroom grout after the July scrub.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
