35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The receipts show we spend 2,300 yen monthly on supplies, often buying duplicates.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,A full pass takes over two hours. That is a significant chunk of my week.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Two people are away most months, yet they count the same in the rota.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,The arguments always start with someone reminding another about a missed task.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The previous tenants divided rooms permanently, but by year two, they barely spoke.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, two hours is too much for one person to handle alone regularly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, exactly. If we hire help, the firm requires a two-hour arrival window.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, the chat logs show the friction comes from ambiguity, not malice.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, I agree. But the bathroom grout gets dirty again in eleven days.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, the management office charges 4,200 yen an hour for a cleaner.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"4,200 yen an hour is expensive, but it might be cheaper than our time.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The firm's terms say they work around mess, so we still need to tidy up.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If we rotate, the absent people still get their turn, which feels unfair.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,I need a system where I don't have to check the bathroom before entering.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,Permanent assignments seem to kill the social bond. We need something flexible.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I am leaning towards paying for the service to remove the burden.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am concerned about the prep work required for the outside firm.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,A fixed rota might be the only way to ensure fairness despite absences.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"I want a clear standard. If we pay, we need to define what they do.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,I worry that a rigid rota will cause the same silence as the previous tenants.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
