60,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A is standing assignments. Option B is a paid service. Option C is a fixed rota.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option B removes the two-hour block from my schedule, which is appealing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option C is fair on paper, but it ignores the absences I found.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"Option A feels risky. If I own the bathroom, I am always on call.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Option C is what the previous tenants did, and it failed socially.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if we choose B, we split the 4,200 yen hourly rate.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, that is manageable if we only book it once a week.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, Option B means we don't have to guess the state of the rooms.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, yes, but I need to know if the firm cleans the grout.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, I am worried about the cost, but I value our harmony more.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"The cost is high, but it buys us time and peace.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I can handle the coordination if we go with B.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I prefer C for fairness, but B is more practical given the absences.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,I vote for B. I want to stop bracing myself before entering the bathroom.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,"I am hesitant about the cost, but I don't want to repeat the previous tenants' mistake.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I am voting for B. It is the most sustainable financially and temporally.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am voting for B. It removes the heavy lifting from my week.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,I am voting for B. It is the only option that accounts for our varying presence.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,I am voting for B.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Midori,,I am voting for B. I hope it keeps us on speaking terms.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
